verything else is LAN-only (lan entrypoint, own app login, no Authentik).&lt;br&gt;Services outside the cluster (LXCs, Unraid) are reached through argo-apps external-services endpoints.&lt;br&gt;TLS: one wildcard certificate *.example.com (cert-manager, Cloudflare DNS-01)." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#bbbbbb;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="700" width="1160" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
